added:        2026-10-17 by salim-slimani (agent)
notes:        Timeline: a cross-dissolve and dip-to-black on V1, a scaled Misty_Forest insert on V2, the streaming video thumbnails, coloured named markers on the ruler, the Ambient_Score.wav music bed on A2 and the demo media on A1. 944x328 crop. Every frame shown is FilmSweet's own procedurally generated demo media (crates/media/src/generators.rs); contains no third-party, Adobe or copyrighted footage. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
